Intended use
------------
NeoDSE manages operational information displays and notifications. It has not
been qualified as a safety-critical alarm or protective-control system.
Acceptance of an API request does not confirm execution on connected equipment.
Administrators are responsible for assessing suitability, securing and
maintaining their deployment, and validating connected displays and peripherals.

